20px grid\" fxlayoutgap.gt-lg=\"24px grid\"><div fxflex.gt-lg=\"50\" class=\"faq__title\"><h2 class=\"primary-heading ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"\">What you need to know</h2><!----><div class=\"all-faqs ng-star-inserted\"><a id=\"viewAllFaq\" class=\"faq_link_button ng-star-inserted\" target=\"_self\" href=\"/en-SA/\n                  \" aria-label=\"\"><span> Still have questions? </span><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-icons-outlined faq_icon icon-Link_chevron\"> chevron_right </span></a><!----></div><!----></div><div fxflex.gt-lg=\"50\"><mat-accordion class=\"mat-accordion faq__accordion\"><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-29 mat-expanded mat-expansion-panel-spacing ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-30 ng-tns-c1859850774-29 ng-animate-disabled mat-expanded mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"Do I earn Miles when redeeming?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-9\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-9\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-30\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-30\"> Do I earn Miles when redeeming? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-30 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-29 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-9\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-9\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-29\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\">An AlFursan member is not entitled to earn Miles through Reward Tickets. For tickets upgraded by Miles you will earn the original ticket Miles.</p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-31 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-32 ng-tns-c1859850774-31 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"How do I upgrade my travel class using my miles online?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-10\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-10\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-32\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-32\"> How do I upgrade my travel class using my miles online? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-32 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-31 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-10\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-10\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-31\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\">Simply login to your AlFursan online account, select “My Trips” under “Reservation”. After completing the reservation, if there are seats available for upgrade, you will be guided towards completing your transaction.</p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-33 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-34 ng-tns-c1859850774-33 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"How to redeem miles?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-11\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-11\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-34\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-34\"> How to redeem miles? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-34 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-33 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-11\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-11\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-33\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\">Miles can be redeemed on your AlFursan online account. Sign into your membership account and choose ‘Redeem Miles’. Alternatively, you can redeem rewards through the SAUDIA guest care center.</p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><mat-expansion-panel class=\"mat-expansion-panel ng-tns-c1859850774-35 ng-star-inserted\"><mat-expansion-panel-header role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header mat-focus-indicator un-panel-class ng-tns-c2690051721-36 ng-tns-c1859850774-35 ng-animate-disabled mat-expansion-toggle-indicator-after ng-star-inserted\" aria-label=\"What is Reward+?\" id=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-12\" aria-controls=\"cdk-accordion-child-12\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-disabled=\"false\"><span class=\"mat-content ng-tns-c2690051721-36\"><mat-panel-title id=\"expPanel\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-title ng-tns-c2690051721-36\"> What is Reward+? </mat-panel-title></span><span class=\"mat-expansion-indicator ng-tns-c2690051721-36 ng-trigger ng-trigger-indicatorRotate ng-star-inserted\"></span><!----></mat-expansion-panel-header><div role=\"region\" class=\"mat-expansion-panel-content ng-tns-c1859850774-35 ng-trigger ng-trigger-bodyExpansion\" id=\"cdk-accordion-child-12\" aria-labelledby=\"mat-expansion-panel-header-12\"><div class=\"mat-expansion-panel-body ng-tns-c1859850774-35\"><p class=\"mat-panel-body-custom ng-star-inserted\">Reward+ opens more seats on all Saudia flights to be claimed as reward tickets in exchange for AlFursan Miles. It means reward seats will be available on more flights to more destinations, when members want them. The reward rate for these flights is higher based on higher demand.</p><!----><!----></div></div></mat-expansion-panel><!----><!----></mat-accordion></div></div></div></div><!----></app-jss-faq><!----></sc-placeholder><!----><!----></app-jss-miles-calculator><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><!----></sc-placeholder>"}